    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d336">

                <pb facs="0371" n="281" xml:id="pg281"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/2335c</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Consul at Vladivostok</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Caldwell</hi>)<anchor n="1" xml:id="d336-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-07-13T17:00:00+09:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 13, 1918,
                                5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Please obtain information desired for Military Intelligence Branch General Staff
                    concerning Czecho-Slovaks, Red Guards, armed and unarmed prisoners of war as to:
                    (1) Location of forces; (2) numerical strength; (3) movements; (4) number and
                    make of rifles and ammunition supply; (5) artillery: number and size of guns and
                    ammunition supply.</p>
                <p>Inform Harris this information desired
                    also from Irkutsk and Krasnoyarsk, Tomsk, Chelyabinsk, and other places in
                    Siberia.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Polk</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d336-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d336-f1-content">
                <p>The same, on the same date, to the Consul at Moscow, except that the final
                    paragraph reads as follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>This information desired from all points of Russia that you are able to
                            reach and especially along Volga River and Orenburg
                        district.</p></quote></p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
